1
00:00:02,500 --> 00:00:05,326
MARROW: Psst. Hey... you. Yes, you. It's midnight.

2
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:11,316
♪ When the clock strikes twelve and the owls all hoot,

3
00:00:11,250 --> 00:00:15,066
♪ we climb on out in our Sunday suits,

4
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:18,816
♪ we dust off our ribs and we polish our toes,

5
00:00:18,750 --> 00:00:22,800
♪ and we tap, tap, tap wherever the wind blows.

6
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:26,316
♪ Clickety clack, the bones come back,

7
00:00:26,016 --> 00:00:30,066
♪ the moon is up and the night is black!

8
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:33,581
♪ Shake your shins and rattle your spine,

9
00:00:33,516 --> 00:00:37,566
♪ everybody's dancing and the dark feels fine!

10
00:00:37,500 --> 00:00:41,081
♪ There's a pot by the door goes bubble pop,

11
00:00:41,250 --> 00:00:45,066
♪ there's a pumpkin on drums who won't stop!

12
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:48,816
♪ a cat on a fiddle, a bat on a horn,

13
00:00:48,750 --> 00:00:52,331
♪ and we dance, dance, dance till the break of morn!

14
00:00:52,500 --> 00:00:56,316
♪ Clickety clack, the bones come back,

15
00:00:56,016 --> 00:01:00,066
♪ the moon is up and the night is black!

16
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:03,581
♪ Shake your shins and rattle your spine,

17
00:01:03,516 --> 00:01:07,566
♪ everybody's dancing and the dark feels fine!

18
00:01:07,750 --> 00:01:10,516
MARROW: Your turn, little ghost! Give us a clack!

19
00:01:10,716 --> 00:01:12,507
ALICE: Um... okay...

20
00:01:15,307 --> 00:01:18,054
ALICE: I... I can't. I don't have any bones.

21
00:01:18,254 --> 00:01:20,951
ALICE: I can't clickety... and I can't clack.

22
00:01:21,651 --> 00:01:25,904
MARROW: Hmm. Little one... look around. Nobody here sounds the same.

23
00:01:26,104 --> 00:01:30,520
MARROW: The bones go clack. The pot goes bubble. And the cat goes...

24
00:01:30,470 --> 00:01:32,561
CAT: Mrrrow.

25
00:01:32,761 --> 00:01:35,525
SIMMER: And I go bubble, dearie. Very loudly.

26
00:01:35,825 --> 00:01:38,621
MARROW: So tell me... what does a ghost go?

27
00:01:39,321 --> 00:01:41,594
ALICE: A ghost goes... boo?

28
00:01:41,794 --> 00:01:42,805
MARROW: Louder!

29
00:01:43,005 --> 00:01:46,587
♪ Boo!

30
00:01:46,755 --> 00:01:50,571
♪ Clickety clack, the bones come back,

31
00:01:50,271 --> 00:01:54,321
♪ the moon is up and the night is black!

32
00:01:54,255 --> 00:01:57,837
♪ Bones go clack and the pot goes pop,

33
00:01:57,771 --> 00:02:01,587
♪ and a little ghost goes BOO at the top!

34
00:02:01,755 --> 00:02:06,743
♪ Everybody's got a sound of their own,

35
00:02:06,755 --> 00:02:14,555
♪ so sing it out loud, you were never alone!

36
00:02:14,805 --> 00:02:15,737
EVERYONE: Boo!

